。在这个例子中，x 是一个复合函数：x = cos(u) 且 u = t^2 + 1。我们有"},{"x":0.54146,"y":0.86469,"w":0.18233,"h":0.02727,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"t":"dx/du = -sin(u) x = cos(u)"},{"x":0.54036,"y":0.8996,"w":0.01634,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"du"},{"x":0.5422,"y":0.9046,"w":0.18267,"h":0.02228,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"dt = 2t. u = t^2 + 1"}]}